$DIR/test.p:3:17: parameter #2 has no default value but follows parameter #1, which has one
    A call may leave out only trailing parameters. So once a parameter has a
    default value, every parameter after it needs one too.
    (see "Default parameter values" in the Plutonium spec, section 10.13)
    (run "pluto explain E2203" for a longer explanation)
